    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "That being said, considering the client requirements for high-quality service and the need to optimize costs, our could explore strategies to reduce our variable costs, which account for 65 percent of our project costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One possible approach is to renegotiate rates with subcontractors, as mentioned in our cost sensitivity information, to absorb potential budget reductions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our could consider proposing a pricing model that incorporates our standard daily rates for senior architects, project managers, and other relevant personnel, while also factoring in the infrastructure margin percentage of 12 percent and software licence resale margin percentage of 8 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By carefully managing these costs and ensuring efficient resource allocation, our may be able to enhance our competitiveness while maintaining the required quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is essential to note that our minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18 percent, which will guide our negotiations and pricing strategy for this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further optimize costs, our could discuss potential scope reductions or removal of optional modules with the client, should budget constraints become a concern." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, any such adjustments would need to be carefully evaluated to ensure any such adjustments do not compromise the quality of service expected by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The requirements include assisting agents in agents daily missions (req:req7), facilitating access to information (req:req8), and improving the quality of answers (req:req9), which suggest a need for innovative AI solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the AI components of we proposal to meet The requirements, and what specific AI technologies or techniques (e.g., LLMs, RAG) do you recommend to ensure we provide a cutting-edge solution that enhances administrative efficiency and user experience?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements for assisting agents in agents daily missions, facilitating access to information, and improving the quality of answers, we can leverage we expertise in AI research and development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we experience with large language models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), we can design a solution that incorporates large language models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, we can utilize we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, to provide agents with accurate and relevant information. our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct has strong French-language performance, which is beneficial since the client's context implies a need for support in French-language." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct Apache 2.0 license allows for self-hosting, ensuring data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to information, we can implement RAG capabilities, which enable the retrieval of relevant documents or passages from internal procedures and applicable regulation. we experience with vector stores like Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS can help in efficiently storing and retrieving this information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating vector stores like Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS, agents can quickly access the information agents need, thereby enhancing agents productivity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve the quality of answers, we can fine-tune we LLMs using methods such as LoRA or QLoRA on a domain-specific corpus. fine-tune has been shown to yield an average accuracy gain of 12%, which can significantly enhance the quality of responses provided to agents and users alike." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we expertise in explainability and trust techniques, including source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME, can be applied to provide transparent and trustworthy AI-driven recommendations. applied is particularly important for ensuring that agents and users understand the basis of the answers and suggestions provided by the system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI technologies and techniques, we can create a cutting-edge solution that not only meets but exceeds the client's expectations for enhancing administrative efficiency and user experience. we proposal will focus on designing an intelligent assistance tool that is accessible from the agents' work environment, accompanies the agents in the agents administrative activities, and provides help with drafting letters or answers to users, all while respecting regulatory requirements and ensuring data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information (con:con37) and expects the proposed solution to contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption (con:con38), relying as much as possible on infrastructures with low carbon impact (con:con39)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure we proposal aligns with these sustainability goals, and what specific measures or technologies should we include to demonstrate we commitment to environmental responsibility and digital sobriety? we can ensure our proposal aligns with The client sustainability goals by leveraging we existing environmental capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, we have partnerships with green hosting providers OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By utilizing partnerships with green hosting providers OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy, we can significantly reduce the carbon footprint associated with the proposed solution infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy that ensures a minimum 5-year lifecycle for we equipment. our digital sobriety practices not only reduce energy consumption but also contribute to the reduction of electronic waste. we also have a carbon reporting capability based on GRI Standards (partial), which allows we to measure and report the carbon footprint of we operations, including the proposed solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This transparency is crucial in demonstrating we commitment to environmental responsibility and digital sobriety." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further align with The client goals, we can emphasize the use of low-power standby modes and recommend that clients subscribe to renewable energy Guarantee of Origin certificates for any on-premise servers, as outlined in we known CSR tensions resolutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By incorporating these measures into our proposal, we demonstrate a clear commitment to reducing energetic consumption, minimizing environmental footprint, and promoting digital sobriety, all while relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Eurocloud Solutions S.A., Lexia GmbH, and Greencompute S.R.L., proposes a comprehensive solution for the Region Lombardia tender. proposes integrates AI components, ensures high security and compliance standards, and prioritizes environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will leverage technologies like Mistral 7B, LLaMA, Apache Kafka, Docker, Kubernetes, and Prometheus to deliver an efficient and scalable solution. # 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Understanding of Requirements The client requires a solution that improves administrative efficiency and user experience while ensuring data sovereignty and regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed system must integrate with existing systems of information, business software, electronic management of documents, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, The proposed system should meet specific security standards, including GDPR compliance, and prioritize environmental sustainability. # 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
