    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirements for implementing an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents (req:req1), improving efficiency of administrative services (req:req2), and improving quality of service rendered to users (req:req3), and considering the constraints of integrating into existing practices of agents (con:con7) and not constituting a rupture in agents modes of work (con:con8), how should we coordinate the consortium to produce a coherent tender response, ensuring decision traceability and detecting potential contradictions?" ;
